				<wikidot:authorName>Genshed</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2643500</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Well, old man Darke is a delightful addition to the Mickey D gang. Intriguing world building, lots of atmospheric detail, and the promise of more to come. The suggestion that Iris herself may not necessarily be who she thinks she is was especially good; that she doesn't apparently *care* is even better.</p> 
				 	]]>
